  "name": "Large Shadow Serpentis Synchronizer",
  "description": "Serpentis developed this synchronizer from stolen Gallente and Minmatar technology. It improves hybrid turret performance, ship maximum velocity, and web resistance. However, Serpentis R&D was unable to recreate the clean signal of the originals, and this rig significantly reduces targeting range. It also integrates the pathways between Shadow Serpentis technology. This unlocks even greater performance the more Shadow Serpentis modules are installed.\n\nPenalty: Using more than one type of this module or similar modules that affect the same attribute on the ship will be penalized.\n\nThe CPU drawbacks of fitting this rig may be reduced by training the <a href=showinfo:96100>Synchronization Rigging</a> skill.",
